#     battery (all 9 TA kinds, Buffer, Array, ArrayBuffer, DataView, plain
#     object, null, undefined, number, string, bool, Set, Map, RegExp,
#     function, arrow, Date, Error, Symbol, bigint, arguments, WeakMap).
#   - codec round-trip (encode->JSON.stringify->JSON.parse->decode) preserves
